{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ま...りんごすきとかキャラやしな」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...て、あれ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空耳かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......知らない知らない\n聞こえてない聞こえてない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近なににハマってる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"COOKPAD見ること"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかぱって何だと思うー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？おかぱ...？\nおかっぱ？？ん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスいつも何処で\n過ごしますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家で家族と"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの前でみんな普通に自撮り\nするの？(・ω・)恥ずかしくない？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、慣れると\n自撮りしてるのは\n普通の光景なんだよね笑\n私も気にせず撮ってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははは！アイドルってすごいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか的今年の\n流行語大賞って何だ?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼アメイジング／でしょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の写真のまりっかはすっぴん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです。\nふはは...\n写真加工ってすごいなあー！←ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後輩に何て呼ばれたい？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え！わからん！\nな、なんでもいい！！\nさん付けなんて違和感マックスだ...\nバレエの後輩ちゃんからは\nまりかちゃんだったなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ書くのに\nどれくらいの時間かかる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間があったらちょっとずつ\n書いてるので...どれくらいかは\n日による！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近お買い物行った～？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょくちょく買ってるけど～...\nがっつり買ってないな。\nまた古着屋行きたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子は、あんことみたらし\nどっちが好き？(●´ω｀●)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子にはあんこです！\nでも一番好きな豆類は\nだ  い  ず  ！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆\n19日に発売された\n制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと...\nオリコンデイリーチャート1位！\nありがとうございます><\n☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は乃木ここの収録～\nうふふ～めっちゃ久しぶりじゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハも頑張るぞっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然だけど\n写真のリクエスト応えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば...\n自撮りでこんなポーズしてほしい。\nこんな髪型で撮ってほしい。\nメンバーとの2ショ撮ってほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいなのあれば、\nちょっとずつでも載せたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント待ってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/20/1553930/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"げへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}